WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.358
The four panels are separate checks. Being competent does not create authority.

00:00:04.358 --> 00:00:08.717
Having system access does not prove that the information is reliable or

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:13.075
that enough capacity is available.

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:16.967
The record links a result to its scope, conditions, decision route, evidence

00:00:16.967 --> 00:00:20.667
and review point. This makes limits visible before the assistant accepts the

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:24.367
work.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:29.442
The cards distinguish an individual account from an approved delegation. Approved delegated

00:00:29.442 --> 00:00:34.283
access is not the same as sharing another person’s password. Use the

00:00:34.283 --> 00:00:39.125
organisation’s actual access controls.
